# A new player's start: only home, the machine and collectibles. Pull the lever; on the third pull
# your first pet comes out of the machine (your active pet). Then it's you and the machine for a
# while; once it's built up, a second pet comes out with a map: adventures open, send it.
# Run with: python3 tools/play.py tutorial
from new

expect tutorial pull
expect tab machine
expect fits
shot start
pull 1
expect no-text "psst… pull the lever towards you! something's rattling in here!"
pull 2 1.5
shot first_pet
expect tutorial machine
click tab:collection
shot collectibles
expect no-text "toys"         # hidden until earned: no toys switch yet
expect no-text "???"
tab machine
pull 5
expect tutorial machine
fix tape
fix oil
pull 1 1.5
shot second_pet
expect tutorial send
expect text "tap here to go on an adventure!"
click guide                 # the adventures tab
shot adventures
click guide                 # the garden on the map
click guide                 # a pet
click guide                 # send
wait 1
expect tutorial done
shot done
expect fits
